   "title": "Kogi APC chieftain Kasco dumps party, joins PDP",
   "url": "https://www.vanguardngr.com/2026/11/kogi-apc-chieftain-kasco-dumps-party-joins-pdp/",
   "domain": "vanguardngr.com",
