   "title": "Riot Games to fund conservation of rare Goryeo Buddhist painting held in US",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/business/companies/20261124/riot-games-to-fund-conservation-of-rare-goryeo-buddhist-painting-held-in-us",
