   "title": "President Mahama visits Chris Hesse, recounts efforts to save Ghana’s historical archives",
   "url": "https://www.myjoyonline.com/president-mahama-visits-chris-hesse-recounts-efforts-to-save-ghanas-historical-archives/",
   "domain": "myjoyonline.com",
   "source": "MyJoyOnline（加纳）",
   "published": "Mon, 23 Nov 2026 18:57:07 +0000",
   "_dt": 1795460227.0,
